<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Sekuriti yang dikehendaki diterbitkan menurut seksyen ini hendaklah—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "diterbitkan atau diuntukkan pada bila-bila masa dan atas apa-apa terma, tentang penguntukan, sebagaimana yang diarahkan oleh Menteri Kewangan, selepas berunding dengan Menteri;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/msa@> .
